713-## Further information
714-
715-Beyond the demo build described above, many other use cases and options of the upstream Arm ML Embedded Evaluation kit should work on Alif hardware.<br>
716-One easy alternative build is to replace the image-classification use-case on the M55-HP core with
717-object-detection (face-detection).
718-
